  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Mombella, the premier destination for&nbsp;baby products! Our mission is to provide parents&nbsp;with the highest quality baby products&nbsp;at the most competitive prices. We strive to make sure that our customers are always satisfied with their purchase and that they have a positive experience with us.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">At Mombella, we understand that finding good baby products can be a daunting task. That&rsquo;s why we have a team of knowledgeable and experienced professionals who are dedicated to helping you find the perfect baby items for parents&rsquo; needs. We offer a wide selection of baby products, so you can be sure to find something that fits your budget and lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We also offer a variety of services to make your shopping experience even easier. Our customer service team is available to answer any questions you may have and provide helpful advice.&nbsp; We are committed to providing our customers with the best possible experience. We hope you enjoy shopping with us and look forward to serving you in the future. Thank you for choosing Mombella!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"h2 product-single__title\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: var(--typeHeaderPrimary),var(--typeHeaderFallback); font-weight: var(--typeHeaderWeight); line-height: var(--typeHeaderLineHeight); font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize)*0.85); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">MOMBELLA 2-PACK 4OZ+7OZ BABY FEEDING BOTTLE GIFT SET</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; background: rgb(255,255,255);\">1. Ease the transition between breastfeeding and bottle feeding&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; background: rgb(255,255,255);\">2.&nbsp;Anti-colic, Gas-free</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; background: rgb(255,255,255);\">3. BPA-Free, PVC-Free, LEAD-Free</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; background: rgb(255,255,255);\">4.&nbsp;Ultra Wide Neck Design: makes pouring breast milk inside easier; easy to clean</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; background: rgb(255,255,255);\">5. Also a perfect gift to friends who just&nbsp;has&nbsp;birth&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;baby.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Paypal</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"